  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Burnt-orange primary action with the implemented shine, hover depth and keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"#colecao\">Encontre seu colchão</a>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{position:relative;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:58px;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:32px;font:600 15px/1.35 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;border:0;background:var(--action,#b84214);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgb(0 20 27 / .12);transition:background .35s,box-shadow .35s}.ds-primary:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 30%,rgb(255 255 255 / .24) 45%,transparent 60%);transform:translateX(-140%);transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.19,1,.22,1)}.ds-primary:hover{background:#96340f;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgb(0 20 27 / .22)}.ds-primary:hover:before{transform:translateX(140%)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f17b3b);outline-offset:6px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary,.ds-primary:before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Outlined button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "Paper-text action shown on its petrol scene ground; reverses to paper/night on hover.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dark-ground\"><a class=\"ds-outline\" href=\"#guia\">Descubra seu jeito</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-dark-ground{background:var(--night,#062c34);padding:28px}.ds-outline{position:relative;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:58px;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:32px;font:600 15px/1.35 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--on-dark,#c6dadd);background:transparent;color:var(--paper,#f4f5f1);box-shadow:none;transition:background .35s,box-shadow .35s}.ds-outline:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 30%,rgb(255 255 255 / .24) 45%,transparent 60%);transform:translateX(-140%);transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.19,1,.22,1)}.ds-outline:hover{background:var(--paper,#f4f5f1);color:var(--night,#062c34);box-shadow:none}.ds-outline:hover:before{transform:translateX(140%)}.ds-outline:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f17b3b);outline-offset:6px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-outline,.ds-outline:before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-selected",
      "description": "Brand-filter pill; selected state is conveyed by aria-pressed as in the catalog.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filtrar por marca\"><button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Castor</button><button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Ortobom</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-filters{display:flex;gap:10px}.ds-filter{font:400 14px/1.6 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#516768);padding:10px 21px;min-height:44px;border-radius:25px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s,color .25s}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=true],.ds-filter:hover{background:var(--night,#062c34);color:var(--paper,#f4f5f1)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f17b3b);outline-offset:6px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-filter{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Comfort choice",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "choice-selected",
      "description": "Native radio and bordered choice label with checked and keyboard-focus states; no custom JavaScript required.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-choices\"><label class=\"ds-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-comfort\" value=\"Mais macio\" checked><span>Mais macio</span></label><label class=\"ds-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-comfort\" value=\"Mais firme\"><span>Mais firme</span></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.ds-choice{position:relative;display:block}.ds-choice input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:1px;height:1px}.ds-choice span{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:14px 10px;min-height:54px;border:1px solid #99ada3;border-radius:6px;color:var(--ink,#153e44);font:400 15px/1.6 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}.ds-choice:hover span{cursor:pointer}.ds-choice input:checked+span{background:var(--night,#062c34);color:var(--paper,#f4f5f1);border-color:var(--night,#062c34)}.ds-choice input:focus-visible+span{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f17b3b);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-choice span{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Select field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field-select",
      "description": "Native brand select, transparent on the guide's pale field, with the actual border, radius and focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-select-label\" for=\"ds-brand\">Tem uma marca em mente?</label><select class=\"ds-select\" id=\"ds-brand\" name=\"brand\"><option>Quero conhecer as opções</option><option>Castor</option><option>Ortobom</option><option>Probel</option></select>",
      "css": ".ds-select-label{display:block;color:var(--ink,#153e44);font:500 20px/1.6 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif);margin-bottom:17px}.ds-select{width:100%;padding:15px 20px;min-height:58px;color:var(--ink,#153e44);border:1px solid #99ada3;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;caret-color:var(--orange,#f17b3b);font:400 16px/1.6 var(--body,'DM Sans',sans-serif)}.ds-select:hover{background:transparent}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f17b3b);outline-offset:6px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A living showroom of the next morning",
    "overview": "Deep petrol scenes frame original people, official catalog imagery and tall compressed lettering. Pale comparison fields and open captions give functional controls room to breathe. Orange provides emphasis and a darker action tint.\n\nType, imagery, light and scroll move as coordinated layers. The user's pinned cinematic reference governs this code-led V3; former Cinema B approval claims are rejected history. No approved comp is asserted. The first viewport composition belongs to the surface brief.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Barlow Condensed display with DM Sans reading and controls.",
      "Petrol, pale product fields and separate orange emphasis/action tints.",
      "Original people and official imagery with honest context.",
      "Coordinated motion, manual controls and complete static fallbacks."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Two Oranges Rule",
        "body": "Use light orange for emphasis and focus, and burnt orange for white-text actions.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Legible Support Rule",
        "body": "Use on-dark on petrol and muted on pale fields.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Complete Static Rule",
        "body": "Reduced motion must show complete content and usable controls.",
        "section": "elevation-depth"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve Castor priority alongside Ortobom and Probel.",
      "Do preserve the original couple and recognizable official product imagery.",
      "Do keep visible focus, native controls and complete reduced-motion content.",
      "Do preserve media ratios and clearance around persistent contact."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore the rejected basic layout or former Cinema B approval authority.",
      "Don't replace active Barlow Condensed with legacy Parkinsans.",
      "Don't present catalog imagery as the store interior or confirmed local stock.",
      "Don't invent prices, hours or commercial terms."
    ]
  }
}
